Estimating model parameters
We are now considering the method used to estimate the model parameters and limit our analysis to the ARCHppq
process. The development of estimation methods for the GARCHpp, qq model being similar. In order to estimate the
parameters of the ARCHppq model we employ maximum likelihood estimation seeking the parameter values which
maximise the log-likelihood function.
For the zero-mean ARCHppq process we let L be the overall likelihood, Li be the conditional log-likelihood of
