Hence, we can give a simple digital ﬁltering interpretation to the relation in Equation (G.4.27). This show that the
original signal can be reconstructed from its redundant wavelet decomposition by correctly selecting different sets
of orthonormal coefﬁcients. We are now left with choosing a criterion, such as the entropy, to select the best set of
orthonormal coefﬁcients. Considering the entropy criterion with extra additivity property, Pesquet et al. proposed an
efﬁcient optimisation algorithm.
